{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "rq1142vtxfrw8f1w", "title": "7.多轮对话的上下文建模方法", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"83d4d33c\" id=\"83d4d33c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3cb4b1e6\" id=\"u3cb4b1e6\">一、答题思路</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u259e1ba0\" id=\"u259e1ba0\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752462857259-a23e0be5-50ba-477a-8dac-d70e2f82e291.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u04fa7ef8-bcb1-4b35-81f8-ae536db80ce%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud4fde704-fcf9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A495.3333333333333%2C%22height%22%3A85%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A18601%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A743%2C%22originHeight%22%3A128%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%AD%94%E9%A2%98%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A16%2C%22y%22%3A52%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A37%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%BB%B4%E5%BA%A6%22%2C%22x%22%3A303%2C%22y%22%3A53%2C%22width%22%3A127%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A1%83%E6%88%98%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A581%2C%22y%22%3A33%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A583%2C%22y%22%3A77%2C%22width%22%3A121%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f9f7f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ubd558aa0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u423fbc16\" id=\"u423fbc16\"><span data-lake-id=\"u06539e09\" id=\"u06539e09\">多轮对话的上下文建模是衡量大模型对话系统能力的关键指标。面试中需从</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u84d8d9a2\" id=\"u84d8d9a2\">核心挑战、解决方案、技术实现</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4f8e47ce\" id=\"u4f8e47ce\">三个维度展开，结合真实项目案例说明方法论。以下为结构化思路：</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u77ab3aa3\" id=\"u77ab3aa3\"><br></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"6c12541a\" id=\"6c12541a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2900745e\" id=\"u2900745e\">二、项目案例</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u2b27d687\" id=\"u2b27d687\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752462865629-a71ac925-32ca-4fb8-8d28-2a9f1baaa317.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u2b72070b-52c1-475c-a489-e84ba28d78c%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud4fde704-fcf9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A497.3333333333333%2C%22height%22%3A63%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A16519%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A746%2C%22originHeight%22%3A95%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%94%B5%E5%95%86%E5%AE%A2%E6%9C%8D%22%2C%22x%22%3A303%2C%22y%22%3A28%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A27%2C%22width%22%3A114%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E7%97%9B%E7%82%B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A582%2C%22y%22%3A6%2C%22width%22%3A123%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E9%9A%BE%E7%82%B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A579%2C%22y%22%3A50%2C%22width%22%3A121%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f6f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u34840130%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"bdf101a5\" id=\"bdf101a5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u06e9e30c\" id=\"u06e9e30c\">案例背景：电商智能客服多轮对话系统</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u35a42710\" id=\"u35a42710\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8be39bb0\" id=\"u8be39bb0\">场景</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u85a51bed\" id=\"u85a51bed\">：用户在电商平台咨询某款手机电池续航问题后，继续询问售后服务政策，系统需结合历史对话提供连贯回答。 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0b6c94c2\" id=\"u0b6c94c2\">痛点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub1188073\" id=\"ub1188073\">：</span></p><ol list=\"u47a3561d\"><li fid=\"u7dd05ff3\" data-lake-id=\"ud4a778cd\" id=\"ud4a778cd\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub5796aff\" id=\"ub5796aff\">长上下文处理</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue9355e33\" id=\"ue9355e33\">：用户多轮提问可能涉及数十轮交互，传统模型难以捕捉远距离依赖。</span></li><li fid=\"u7dd05ff3\" data-lake-id=\"u86349e52\" id=\"u86349e52\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubd2708c3\" id=\"ubd2708c3\">实体一致性</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uff9901f9\" id=\"uff9901f9\">：需维护商品型号、用户历史问题等实体信息的一致性。</span></li><li fid=\"u7dd05ff3\" data-lake-id=\"u7bd0f816\" id=\"u7bd0f816\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u27d2e58a\" id=\"u27d2e58a\">对话逻辑断裂</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5747e429\" id=\"u5747e429\">：用户跳跃式提问（如从电池续航跳转到退货政策）时，模型易丢失上下文关联。</span></li></ol><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nXtRR%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"bd6c56ad\" id=\"bd6c56ad\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3bd46919\" id=\"u3bd46919\">三、参考回答</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u17e5bea4\" id=\"u17e5bea4\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752462950613-4ad0ecfc-b714-4abc-90a7-d9bd7f5758ae.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u1f3bfd54-8c33-4d6a-94ae-b5019be302c%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ud4fde704-fcf9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A511.3333333333333%2C%22height%22%3A159%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A40386%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A767%2C%22originHeight%22%3A238%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8A%A8%E6%80%81%E7%AA%97%E5%8F%A3%E7%AE%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A570%2C%22y%22%3A148%2C%22width%22%3A150%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%AE%9E%E4%BD%93%E8%AE%B0%E5%BF%86%E7%BD%91%22%2C%22x%22%3A571%2C%22y%22%3A105%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%A4%9A%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%22%2C%22x%22%3A572%2C%22y%22%3A190%2C%22width%22%3A147%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%87%E5%8E%8B%E7%BC%A9%22%2C%22x%22%3A575%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%A7%A3%E5%86%B3%E6%96%B9%E6%A1%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A289%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A123%2C%22height%22%3A33%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E9%9A%BE%22%2C%22x%22%3A554%2C%22y%22%3A9%2C%22width%22%3A141%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%8C%91%E6%A1%83%E6%88%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A291%2C%22y%22%3A9%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A31%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E5%9B%9E%E7%AD%94%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A66%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A36%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f7f7%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u923978cc%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"79c31019\" id=\"79c31019\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u42d3dbd3\" id=\"u42d3dbd3\">1. 核心挑战</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u9627f587\" id=\"u9627f587\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd9a1a7a\" id=\"ucd9a1a7a\">多轮对话建模需解决三大技术难题：</span></p><ul list=\"uc87e604c\"><li fid=\"udff58fd1\" data-lake-id=\"u3d617cdf\" id=\"u3d617cdf\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5276f06d\" id=\"u5276f06d\">长序列建模</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0adb0b32\" id=\"u0adb0b32\">：传统Transformer的二次复杂度限制了上下文窗口扩展（如GPT-4的8K tokens上限）。</span></li><li fid=\"udff58fd1\" data-lake-id=\"ud70153f1\" id=\"ud70153f1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc1b70f8f\" id=\"uc1b70f8f\">实体与关系追踪</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u17cc3fb0\" id=\"u17cc3fb0\">：需识别跨轮次实体（如商品ID、用户地址）并保持语义一致性。</span></li><li fid=\"udff58fd1\" data-lake-id=\"u9d3790bf\" id=\"u9d3790bf\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc99ead0f\" id=\"uc99ead0f\">对话意图偏移</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u381691a5\" id=\"u381691a5\">：用户可能中途切换话题，模型需动态调整响应策略。 </span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"10a9f7d3\" id=\"10a9f7d3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc5d29257\" id=\"uc5d29257\">2. 解决方案</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"ua73013c3\" id=\"ua73013c3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u79457e6e\" id=\"u79457e6e\">结合项目需求，采用以下分层架构：</span></p><h5 data-lake-id=\"bb7d44a7\" id=\"bb7d44a7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue55175b7\" id=\"ue55175b7\">（1）上下文压缩与检索增强（RAG）</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"u0e0d8e57\"><li fid=\"uc9f9fd17\" data-lake-id=\"u2d9c8363\" id=\"u2d9c8363\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0f49aeb0\" id=\"u0f49aeb0\">问题</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u92e4544c\" id=\"u92e4544c\">：原始对话历史过长导致模型注意力分散。 </span></li><li fid=\"uc9f9fd17\" data-lake-id=\"u0525ca07\" id=\"u0525ca07\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue437d57a\" id=\"ue437d57a\">方案</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf7d85668\" id=\"uf7d85668\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"u0e0d8e57\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"udb2faff5\" data-lake-id=\"uaa5e4702\" id=\"uaa5e4702\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6fdaa40f\" id=\"u6fdaa40f\">使用</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0c478358\" id=\"u0c478358\">MinHash LSH</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud4db5b7e\" id=\"ud4db5b7e\">对历史对话分块，保留关键信息片段。</span></li><li fid=\"udb2faff5\" data-lake-id=\"u293d6174\" id=\"u293d6174\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud5c26730\" id=\"ud5c26730\">通过**向量数据库（Chroma/FAISS）**检索与当前问题相关的历史片段，动态构建上下文窗口。</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u0e0d8e57\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"uc9f9fd17\" data-lake-id=\"u8090af4b\" id=\"u8090af4b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u37e27ed9\" id=\"u37e27ed9\">案例实现</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0fb139da\" id=\"u0fb139da\">： </span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8LangChain%E6%9E%84%E5%BB%BA%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2%E5%A2%9E%E5%BC%BA%E9%93%BE%20%20%5Cnfrom%20langchain.chains%20import%20ConversationalRetrievalChain%20%20%5Cnfrom%20langchain.memory%20import%20ConversationBufferMemory%20%20%5Cn%5Cnmemory%20%3D%20ConversationBufferMemory(memory_key%3D%5C%22chat_history%5C%22)%20%20%5Cnretriever%20%3D%20vector_db.as_retriever(search_kwargs%3D%7B%5C%22k%5C%22%3A%203%7D)%20%20%5Cnrag_chain%20%3D%20ConversationalRetrievalChain.from_llm(llm%2C%20retriever%3Dretriever%2C%20memory%3Dmemory)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AASct%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h5 data-lake-id=\"0d66b21e\" id=\"0d66b21e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1b2a2885\" id=\"u1b2a2885\">（2）实体感知的层次化记忆网络</span></strong></h5><ul list=\"uab2b3d73\"><li fid=\"u1bca3723\" data-lake-id=\"ua65bc800\" id=\"ua65bc800\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u30c25f5b\" id=\"u30c25f5b\">问题</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6ff85a28\" id=\"u6ff85a28\">：跨轮次实体（如商品型号、订单号）易丢失或混淆。</span></li><li fid=\"u1bca3723\" data-lake-id=\"u578b488c\" id=\"u578b488c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u84788cc2\" id=\"u84788cc2\">方案</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3c0a36bb\" id=\"u3c0a36bb\">： </span></li></ul><ul list=\"uab2b3d73\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u38947eeb\" data-lake-id=\"uc413d8f1\" id=\"uc413d8f1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucc9c6a37\" id=\"ucc9c6a37\">实体链接层</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3614acd1\" id=\"u3614acd1\">：通过BERT模型识别对话中的实体（如“iPhone 15 Pro”）。</sp